# MCSP Condition Propagation 0.50

Status: Constructive reconciliation experiment
Qualification: Under Conditional Experiment
Parents:
- PROPAGATION-0.26.mcsp
- CONDITION-CONTINUITY-0.49.mcsp

## Objective

Reconcile established MCSP propagation mechanics with the condition-minimization
architecture.

Kernel remains:

    DETERMINATE CONDITION

Propagation transports qualified semantic/scaffolding determination under explicit
applicability. It SHALL NOT manufacture STATE or TYPE.

## Propagation operations

The established operation vocabulary remains:

    INHERIT
    REFINE
    NARROW
    REALIZE
    PROJECT
    SUSPEND
    REJECT

0.50 exercises INHERIT, REFINE, NARROW and PROJECT as accepted propagation paths,
and SUSPEND/REJECT as contradiction containment paths.

REALIZE remains established vocabulary but is outside this bounded witness because
0.50 is testing semantic propagation rather than a new machine realization.

## Record

A bounded propagated record contains:

    condition
    mode
    applicability
    qualification
    lineage
    propagation_operation
    state_introduced
    type_introduced

STATE and TYPE fields are negative sentinels only. They do not establish those
dimensions as operative ontology.

## Rules

INHERIT:
    preserve qualified determination when governing conditions remain compatible.

REFINE:
    add determination without contradicting inherited determination.

NARROW:
    reduce applicability while preserving the inherited determination inside the
    narrower boundary.

PROJECT:
    express the determination through an applicable operational mode without
    changing its semantic condition.

SUSPEND:
    stop affected propagation when compatibility cannot currently be established.

REJECT:
    refuse propagation when a material contradiction is established.

No accepted propagation operation implies:

    CONDITION -> STATE
    MODE -> TYPE

No repetition, lineage continuity, applicability narrowing, or projection implies
those promotions either.

## Bounded path

    source:
      CONDITION=PROCESSING
      MODE=FOREGROUND
      applicability=GENERAL
      qualification=QUALIFIED

    INHERIT:
      preserves PROCESSING

    REFINE:
      preserves PROCESSING and establishes explicit operational determination

    NARROW:
      applicability GENERAL -> TERMINAL

    PROJECT:
      MODE FOREGROUND -> BACKGROUND
      CONDITION remains PROCESSING

BACKGROUND is a semantic mode value only. It does not detach the process.

## Contradiction containment

A child that attempts to propagate an incompatible condition under an operation
that requires preservation SHALL NOT be silently repaired.

The affected path must be SUSPENDED or REJECTED.

Contradiction therefore stops propagation before stronger semantic dimensions can
be invented to explain it.

## Boundary

0.50 does not introduce terminal release, actual background execution, a state
machine, a type system, or universal propagation semantics.

The 0.26 propagation vocabulary is preserved.
The 0.49 continuity discipline is preserved.
